# APM — Agentic Project Management
<!-- cs: APM — Agentem Řízený Vývoj -->

## Actors
<!-- cs: Aktéři -->

| Actor | Role | Model |
|-------|------|-------|
| **Planner** | Planning, decomposition, context preparation | expensive/complex |
| **Coder** | Implementation, tests, reports | cheaper; per Task Specification |
| **Human** | Final authority, reviewer, decision-maker | — |

<!-- cs: Planner — plánování, dekomposice, příprava kontextu.
     Coder — implementace, testy, reporty.
     Human — finální autorita, reviewer, rozhodování. -->

## APM Phases
<!-- cs: Fáze APM -->

```
Phase 0 (Project Init):  Human → brief.md → [Planner ↔ Human] → spec.md + roadmap.md
Phase E (Epic):          Planner → epic-NNN/plan.md  →  Human approves
Phase T (Task):          Coder reads spec.md → implements → tests → dod.md → report.md
                         Human reviews → approve or reject
Phase ER (Epic Close):   Coder → epic-NNN/report.md  →  [Planner ↔ Human] roadmap review
```

## Document Types
<!-- cs: Typy dokumentů -->

| File | Category value | Written by | Read by |
|------|---------------|------------|---------|
| `brief.md` | `project-brief` | Human | Planner |
| `spec.md` (project) | `project-spec` | Planner | All |
| `roadmap.md` | `roadmap` | Planner | All |
| `epic-NNN/plan.md` | `epic-plan` | Planner | Coder, Human |
| `epic-NNN/task-NNN/spec.md` | `task-spec` | Planner | Coder |
| `epic-NNN/task-NNN/dod.md` | `dod` | Planner (template) → Coder (fills) | Human |
| `epic-NNN/task-NNN/report.md` | `task-report` | Coder | Human |
| `epic-NNN/report.md` | `epic-report` | Coder | Human, Planner |

<!-- cs: brief — neformální zadání. spec — specifikace projektu. roadmap — seznam epik.
     epic-plan — plán epiky (dekomposice na tasky). task-spec — zadání tasku + Context Bundle.
     dod — Definition of Done. task-report — report tasku. epic-report — report epiky. -->

## Directory Structure
<!-- cs: Adresářová struktura -->

```
doc/project-progress/
├── GLOSSARY.md
├── brief.md
├── spec.md
├── roadmap.md
└── epic-010-name/
    ├── plan.md
    ├── report.md
    └── task-010-name/
        ├── spec.md         # Task Specification + Context Bundle
        ├── dod.md          # Definition of Done checklist
        └── report.md       # Task Report
```

Numbering in steps of 10 — insertion: `epic-015-name/` between `epic-010` and `epic-020`.
<!-- cs: Číslování po 10 — vkládání: epic-015-name/ mezi epic-010 a epic-020. -->

## File Header (YAML front matter)
<!-- cs: Záhlaví souboru (YAML front matter) -->

Every APM document **must** start with this front matter:
<!-- cs: Každý APM dokument musí začínat tímto front matter: -->

```yaml
---
apm_category: task-spec         # see Document Types table above
apm_ref: E010.T020              # E010 = epic ref; E010.T020 = task ref
apm_level: task                 # project | epic | task
created_by: Planner             # Planner | Coder | Human
model: claude-opus-4-7          # model used; omit if Human
intended_for: Coder             # Planner | Coder | Human | All
created_at: 2026-05-08
updated_at: 2026-05-08
---
```

## Task Specification — required sections
<!-- cs: Task Specification — povinné sekce -->

1. **Goal** — what to build (1–3 sentences)
2. **Inputs** — files to read, APIs to call, data provided
3. **Outputs** — files to create/modify, interfaces to expose
4. **Context Bundle** — relevant existing files; files NOT to modify; interfaces from prior Tasks
5. **Dependencies** — which Tasks must be completed first
6. **Test Specification** — what tests to write; happy path + edge cases
7. **Definition of Done** — checklist (→ also written to `dod.md`)
8. **Recommended Coder model** — default: Composer-2; complex tasks: stronger model

## Coder — Task Report required sections
<!-- cs: Coder — povinné sekce Task Reportu -->

Language: `<communication-language>` (see `00-communication-language.mdc`)
<!-- cs: Jazyk: <communication-language> (viz 00-communication-language.mdc) -->

1. **Co bylo implementováno** — stručný popis
2. **Vstupy a výstupy** — co bylo přečteno, co bylo vytvořeno/změněno
3. **Použité metody a rozhodnutí** — klíčová architektonická a implementační rozhodnutí
4. **Reference do kódu** — soubory, funkce, rozsahy řádků
5. **Výsledek regresního testu** — ✅ all pass / ❌ failures listed
6. **Definition of Done** — shrnutí (odkaz na dod.md)

## Security guard
<!-- cs: Bezpečnostní zábrany -->

- No `git commit/push` without explicit Human approval.
  <!-- cs: Žádný git commit/push bez explicitního souhlasu člověka. -->
- No database migrations without Human approval.
  <!-- cs: Žádné DB migrace bez souhlasu člověka. -->
- No destructive file operations without confirmation.
  <!-- cs: Žádné destruktivní operace se soubory bez potvrzení. -->
